  "description": "Works to tree with a TPO: Tree 649 - Prunus subhirtella Autumnalis - Winter Flowering Cherry - 2a - Priority Works - Within 1-3 months - Mulch with organic woodchip mulch out to canopy line where this extends over the shrub beds. Deadwood over footpath.\rTree 584 - Prunus subhirtella  Autumnalis - Winter Flowering Cherry - 2a - Priority Works - Within 1-3 months - Fell to ground level. Replant with x1 Prunus sargentii 'Rancho' as 10cm girth unit. Double stake to be planted in planting season (November 2026).\rTree 674 - Robinia pseudoacacia - Robinia - 2a - Priority Works - Within 1-3 months - Deadwood.\rTree 598 - Platanus x hispanica - London Plane - 3d - Cyclic mgmt - 4 yearly - within 3 months - Repollard to previous points (4m).\rTree 599 - Platanus x hispanica - London Plane - 3d - Cyclic mgmt - 4 yearly - within 3 months - Repollard to previous points (6m).\rTree 600 - Platanus x hispanica - London Plane - 3d - Cyclic mgmt - 4 yearly - within 3 months - Repollard to previous points (4m).\rTree 594 - Platanus x hispanica - London Plane - 3d - Cyclic mgmt - 4 yearly - within 3 months - Repollard to previous points (4m).\rTree 595 - Platanus x hispanica - London Plane - 3d - Cyclic mgmt - 4 yearly - within 3 months - Repollard to previous points (4m).\rTree 593 - Prunus avium 'Plena' - Ornamental Wild Cherry - Plena - 5a - General Estate Management - Within 6 months - Cut back off building to provide 2m clearance. Cut back off street lamp to provide 1m clearance.\rTree 602 - Betula albosinensis - Chinese Red Birch - 5a - General Estate Management - Within 6 months - Fell to ground level and replant with same species as 10-12cm girth. Plant centrally.\rTree 601 - Platanus x hispanica - London Plane - 6 - not required to reduce risk - Introduce pollard at 4m.",
